The simple but boring approach is to just wait until you drift into the 
portal.

A slight improvement is to search instead of wait.  If you "find" the
portal, step into it.

Another slight improvement is to wear the Amulet of Yendor, and try to
run towards the direction you're drifting when it gets warmer.

Reading a scroll of gold detection while confused, combined with 
zapping yourself with a wand of teleport, and teleport control is
probably best.
